 - The customer’s payment method currency, such as their credit card or bank account
-- The currency of the charge, called the _presentment_ currency
-- The currency accepted by your destination bank account or debit card, called the _settlement_ currency. To learn more, see [Settle in additional currencies](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/currencies/settlement-payouts.md).
